# GitHub OAuth Application Credentials
# Obtain these from: GitHub Settings > Developer Settings > OAuth Apps
# Documentation: https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps/building-oauth-apps/creating-an-oauth-app

# 1. Your GitHub OAuth App Client ID (Public / Safe for server-side config)
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=Ov23lijzMU0uQsA5Fimr

# 2. Your GitHub OAuth App Client Secret (PRIVATE - NEVER COMMIT OR EXPOSE TO FRONTEND)
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=59ab929af7b8ec8183a1c3c3a8d53af2f08290ee

# 3. Exact Authorized Callback URL registered in your GitHub OAuth App
# Production Vercel URL:
GITHUB_REDIRECT_URI=https://githubgreensquare.vercel.app/api/auth/github/callback

# Local Development URL (if developing locally):
# GITHUB_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/api/auth/github/callback
